{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IsomorphismModule\/documentation\/IsomorphismModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/automorphismGroup()"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The automorphism group: the permutations of the vertices that keep the number of edges"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between every pair of vertices (self-loops included), with generators, orbits and order."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"automorphismGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AutomorphismGroup","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IsomorphismModule\/documentation\/IsomorphismModule\/AutomorphismGroup","preciseIdentifier":"s:17IsomorphismModule17AutomorphismGroupV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Found by individualization–refinement with automorphism pruning (McKay & Piperno 2014;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Junttila & Kaski 2007): the search tree of one graph, each later leaf compared with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first, the branches an automorphism found so far maps onto a searched one skipped. Runs to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion (it does not check for task cancellation). Exponential in the worst case (as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nauty and bliss); near-linear refinement per search node, and on most graphs a few nodes per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"base vertex."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"pa